:"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7741b91e38375b78157afd3ac757c9d6d9bd0139c2f62538ca969f2a8254d9c2","logical_entry_identity":"87f49082764e298111c28bfffa6cdbe27f1a7a270aeff2dec8ec2ffd2e96b5c4","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"deal %0.2f mind damage (based on Mindpower) in a radius 1 around the target","source_tag":"tformat","target":"对目标周围半径 1 码内的敌人造成 %0.2f 点精神伤害（基于精神强度）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4621d51c050f105c70bac302bf37a1ebddbe7ab437e2d574e58324580f6f4c13","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"77606cfae13860330ae6f92b0438f4d4ca82a33444828e6129efcbac59777dff","logical_entry_identity":"ad62f17b5bfd48fec660ceec77e2dd10e1555546418131ac1d11adecd872f2a5","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Orc Warrior","source_tag":"_t","target":"兽人战士"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"696c10d6c00d8770dee2448c5ac91395f8de40cc46bd190043f012422fd8e850","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"777efdc16e4bc090a105bb7e1db92b6d00ad8a81b86f0ddb4a5d2f2132d90099","logical_entry_identity":"c21985034db32aed55778e3a2b26077580a54b3716644ea5203486454f5deefa","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"All powers increased by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"获得 %d 全体强度。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d0e0e8759e78cc434cdbbad5e077bc975a2ee768de5e3b8e7fcdce8ad5a1d6fb","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"778c749fb25e861d5aa7b68cc96460170fe8ac456be3ace5b58ff6244def9e4c","logical_entry_identity":"8babf786fb04178c0e796a067e50375eb4c888bbb2f313d933e8bfdec49304fe","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The anti-scrying nexus you folk set up here is damn impressive, as is the time-release pseudo-rune powered by it - hard to find a spare spot on my skin for it, but I can feel it working for a few days after I'm back in Maj'Eyal.  Great for making sure we can get away from the West portal and disperse without the A.K. catching on or tracking us to a common point of convergence.\n\nGot a proposal, though.  With a few little tweaks, I could make one that doesn't require the bearer's consent to use.  You aren't the only ones buying slaves from me, and when I get a customer who wants them taken right back to the West, we have to do the anti-scrying enchantments ourselves.  I don't know if you've noticed, but proper mages still aren't easy to come by - I barely made a profit last time I did it.\n\nSay the word, and I'll send over the temporary rune design so you can set the nexus to recognize it.  No charge from me - if you accept it, it'll pay for itself.\n\n[i](You assume the elaborate, glowing shape below is an Ogric equivalent to a signature.)[/i] ","source_tag":"_t","target":"老兄，你们设置的反侦测水晶真他妈够劲的，还有这个被它驱动的延时释放的伪符文——我的皮肤上没有什么空位了，但我能感受到，这玩意儿在我回马基埃亚尔之后几天都能用。这肯定能保证，我们可以安心从西部的传送门逃走，绝对不会被联合王国抓到，他们也肯定没法追踪我们的痕迹。\n\n现在，我现在有一个想法。只要稍微整一下，我就可以让这玩意儿不需要使用者的意愿就能工作。你不是唯一一个从我这里买奴隶的人，要是你想把他们带回西部去的话，我们可得好好做点反侦测的准备。我不知道你有没有注意到，但合格的法师如今还是很难请到——上次，我差点把老本都给赔光了。\n\n只要你一句话，我就把这个临时的符文设计发给你，你设置好水晶就能用了。我不收你的钱——只要你愿意用，这笔投入很快就能回本。\n\n[i]（你猜想，下面画着的这个精心设计的，闪闪发光的图案，在食人魔文化里有着和签名一样的用途。）[/i] "},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d4a98571be6d56c6f39ded7d9cb9936b93cef17f47c2d22fa607ca5339ce440e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"77a1d3beebb40244ba7f22d020c63686a3ccaf0791ba361412758c21f10857f9","logical_entry_identity":"3a2ac3fc9b9afb026bb5cbe4bdbc03aad2ed1735cc733adc81ece934171076da","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Target# is overflowing with dark power!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target# 充满了黑暗能量！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b23b51b29f26270ffc094e4949d4aba06d9d6fe97b36fa6fd2c6a9424cf03e83","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"77c3263acda89b05ee31d8f02dab2cc2a9dd915f1069c177397dfa608c038527","logical_entry_identity":"e36ca6f64f63c83e12b80e7dbbbdfabdf38ab0b6a948f3fc085b0555e05f1028","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"may infect the target with a random disease","source_tag":"_t","target":"可能触发随机疾病"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec8087b79cff69c356cf521fd3a3aedba6ab886e24fbe87a82a91